From 398a2710b9c789ccfa05914a80f83565339426a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: plotarmordev <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:13:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/30] drama: checkpoint weights stream onto the GPU with
 direct I/O in file order

stager.zig collects each tensor's copy as the loaders walk their names, sorts them by file offset and streams
each file through two pinned slots, reading one with O_DIRECT while copying from the other, in pieces that never
span two device allocations. A file system that accepts an O_DIRECT open but refuses the read falls back to the
page cache for that descriptor.
